# Crafting is routinable
#
# A successful USE at a station the player may use teaches a Craft routine: the ruin's anvil, as a
# blacksmith. Learned as the menu opens, read once the visit is over.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm blacksmithing --grant-item hammer --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Ruin" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Old Anvil"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal use
means blacksmithing
advance 12 180
click observe "Test Old Anvil"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Old Anvil"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click act 0
choose 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click act 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
click continue
wait mode Crafting 30
craft leave
wait mode LocationInteraction 30
expect-state routines category=craft
expect-state routines trade=blacksmithing tool=-
quit
